OL,3,GNEWSAVHS proving its appeal at 'last
OL,4,Avideo rental shop'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mock shop styling itself as the "last
OL,7,Fvideo rental store" has been reigniting
OL,8,Fa love of physical media in visitors.
OL,10,FThe Video Vault in Newport on the Isle
OL,11,Fof Wight was set up on a whim by couple
OL,12,FLeif Marriner and Sam Young, and they
OL,13,Fhave been busy ever since.
OL,15,FMarriner said they have had people
OL,16,Fdropping in to watch old sci-fi
OL,17,Fprogrammes they cannot see anywhere
OL,18,Felse, and he has also been helping
OL,19,Fpeople digitise their old family
OL,20,Fvideos.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
