OL,3,GNEWSAVHS proving its appeal at 'last
OL,4,Avideo rental shop'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tapes are not really available to
OL,7,Frent - it is more of an exhibition or
OL,8,Ftime capsule - but the couple say they
OL,9,Fnow want to up the ante and make it
OL,10,F"more immersive".
